      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/atualiza%C3%A7%C3%B5es-das-isos-customizadas-do-esxi-6-7-para-update-3/images/esxi-u3.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;826&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;253&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/atualiza%C3%A7%C3%B5es-das-isos-customizadas-do-esxi-6-7-para-update-3/images/esxi-u3_hu_674fe77ee4995f9c.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/atualiza%C3%A7%C3%B5es-das-isos-customizadas-do-esxi-6-7-para-update-3/images/esxi-u3_hu_674fe77ee4995f9c.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/atualiza%C3%A7%C3%B5es-das-isos-customizadas-do-esxi-6-7-para-update-3/images/esxi-u3.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/atualiza%C3%A7%C3%B5es-das-isos-customizadas-do-esxi-6-7-para-update-3/images/esxi-u3.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Essa semana fiz a atualização para o &lt;strong&gt;ESXI 6.7&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update 3&lt;/strong&gt; das minhas &lt;strong&gt;ISOs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Customizadas&lt;/strong&gt; com os drivers de rede de placas realtek, drivers de rede para placas USB e da interface web.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
